# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# Editor noise
.vscode/*.log
.idea/

# 하니스 자체의 운영 데이터 — commit 대상이 아님
# (codex 비대화형 출력에서 stdout 캡쳐한 tmp 등)
*.tmp
*.bak
.cache/

# .claude는 settings.local만 보호 (settings 공유본은 commit 가능)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Dogfood / test examples — kept locally, not pushed to public repo.
# Each example is a full sub-project (starpin / starpin-fleet / fleet-mini / temp-sensor / todo-api)
# used for harness development; not needed by harness consumers.
examples/

# Operational byproducts of the harness itself (codex run accounting + processed inbox archive).
# These regenerate per-session and are not deliverable artifacts.
.harness/codex-token-ledger.jsonl
INBOX/processed/
